profile_default/
ipython_config.py

# pyenv
#   For a library or package, you might want to ignore these files since the values are
#   specific to the developer's machine and shouldn't be shared.
# .python-version

# pipenv
#   According to pypa/pipenv#598, it is recommended to include Pipfile.lock in version control.
#   However, in case of collaboration, if delegates have different OS or Python versions,
#   it might cause issues.
# Pipfile.lock

# poetry
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, poetry.lock is generally recommended, but can be ignored in some cases.
# poetry.lock

# pdm
#   Similar to Pipfile.lock, pdm.lock is generally recommended, but can be ignored in some cases.
# pdm.lock

